: Applicant`s reply: Attached 10/30/2025: Revised BP has been uploaded for review."},{"title":"Games","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-31","description":"Please advise if the Crypto Games are propriety of the company. If so please upload game certificates","notes":"10/15/2025: Applicant`s reply: \"Please note that Ascend Entertainment is a new company that is now starting up, there are no games as of yet.\" 10/15/2025: Dear applicant, according to your previous correspondence you stated that Ascend Entertainment is a newly established company and that no games had been implemented at that time. Kindly confirm if this is still the case. If games have since been developed or implemented, please advise accordingly and upload the corresponding game certificates. 10/15/2025: GC. 10/30/2025: Applicant1s reply: The crypto casino is not operational yet. Thus, the situation is the same, no game has been implemented yet."},{"title":"Domains","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-31","description":"Domains in application relate to another entity owned by UBO.. Please confirm names of domains which will operate under this license.","notes":"10/15/2025: Applicant`s reply: \"WWW.JONBET.IO\""},{"title":"QPA/2024/00963 - Nicholas Beugg - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-15","description":"SOW is not valid. Please submit a SOW along with certified supporting evidence in order to support the business.","notes":"10/15/2025: This serves as a reminder that the submitted SOW does not meet the applicable requirements. You are hereby requested to submit a revised and certified SOW together with certified supporting evidence demonstrating the nature and scope of the business activities. If you are unable to update this document in the Base section, kindly upload it under the Extra Documentation section instead. Uploaded in the extra Please note that failure to provide a certified SOW and the required supporting documentation may result in delays in the assessment of your application or rejection thereof. 10/15/2025: GC. 10/30/2025: Applicant`s reply: Nicholas Beugg’s wealth originates mainly from his entrepreneurial ventures and investment activities. After starting his investment journey in 2015 by trading U.S. and international equities, his most significant wealth generation came in 2018 when he co-founded Black & White Group (“Blaze”), an online gaming company operating in Brazil. Blaze quickly became one of the fastest-growing online gaming platforms in the country, driving substantial financial success for Beugg. The rapid expansion and profitability of Black & White Group/Blaze form the core of his wealth, complemented by his earlier and ongoing investments in U.S. equities through accounts with firms such as Charles Schwab and Oppenheimer. Attached you will find the supporting and certified documents."},{"title":"QPA/2024/00965 - Nick Van Gorsel - SOW","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-15","description":"SOW is not valid. Please submit a SOW along with certified supporting evidence in order to support the business.","notes":"10/15/2025: This serves as a reminder that the submitted SOW does not meet the applicable requirements. You are hereby requested to submit a revised and certified SOW together with certified supporting evidence demonstrating the nature and scope of the business activities. If you are unable to update this document in the Base section, kindly upload it under the Extra Documentation section instead. Please note that failure to provide a certified SOW and the required supporting documentation may result in delays in the assessment of your application or rejection thereof. 10/15/2025: GC. 10/30/2025: Applicant`s reply: Nick Van Gorsel’s wealth originates mainly from his entrepreneurial ventures and investment activities and his ownership in Black & White Group, the parent company of Blaze, an online gaming platform operating in Brazil. He co-founded the company in 2018, and its rapid growth made it one of the fastest-growing gaming firms in the country. The success of Blaze generated approximately $400 million of his total $403 million net worth, with the remainder held in investment and bank accounts in the Netherlands. Attached you will find certified and supporting documentation"},{"title":"Clarification - Domains","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-31","description":"Clarification - Domains Registered Under Ascend","notes":"10/30/2025: Applicant`s reply: The jonbet URL's are under Ascend and will be removed from under Prolific"},{"title":"Statutory Documents","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-10-31","description":"Confirm whether the submitted Company Structure dated October 23, 2024, is the most recent version on file.","notes":"10/30/2025: Applicant`s reply: attached"},{"title":"QPA/2025/03586 - Miruna Mihailescu - PHDF","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-03","description":"PHDF not digitally signed . Please reupload.","notes":"11/26/2025: Applicant's reply: Please note that the PHDF is signed on page 9 digitally"},{"title":"QPA/2025/03586 - Miruna Mihailescu - Proof of address","tag":"Proof of Address","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-03","description":"Kindly note that the proof of address is not valid. We would require an actual utility bill that clearly displays the address.","notes":"11/26/2025: Applicant's reply: the address is displayed clearly on the first page of the utility bill as \"THE GABLES, BLK C, FL 3, TRIQ PISCOPO MACEDONIA, SAN PAWL IL-BAHAR SPB 1500\" Please indicate what else is required."}]}]}]}